OL,3,GNEWSAFormer off-licence owner banned
OL,4,Aafter investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former owner of an off-licence has
OL,7,Fbeen banned from being a company
OL,8,Fdirector after investigators could not
OL,9,Ffind what happened to nearly #220,000
OL,10,Ftransferred to him.
OL,12,FPal Chopra, 52, was the director of
OL,13,FReading Food & Wine Ltd, which operated
OL,14,Fin Friar Street before it went into
OL,15,Fliquidation in December 2024.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
