OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer off-licence owner banned
OL,4,Aafter investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Insolvency Service said its
OL,7,Finvestigators found Chopra, from
OL,8,FSouthall, London, received #219,402
OL,9,Fdirectly from the company's bank
OL,10,Faccount but "inadequate records" meant
OL,11,Fthey could not establish the nature of
OL,12,Fthe payments.
OL,14,FChopra's six-year ban started on Friday
OL,15,Fand bars him from promoting, forming or
OL,16,Fmanaging a company without permission.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
